<header><h1>Uncertainty module: sampling, evaluation and interpretation</h1>
<p>Draft for maintainer review</p></header>
<div class="layout"><nav aria-label="Contents"><ol>
<li><a href="#section-1">Executive Summary</a></li><li><a href="#section-2">Introduction</a></li>
<li><a href="#section-3">Inputs and Outputs</a></li><li><a href="#section-4">Basis and Criteria</a></li>
<li><a href="#section-5">Methodology</a></li><li><a href="#section-6">Detailed Results</a></li>
